Package: scminerViewer
Type: Package
Title: View scMINER Studies via Shiny
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("scMINER", "Team", email = "scminer@stjude.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Processes scMINER study data and serves it via a Shiny
    application. Emits both the graph-import layout used by the scMINER
    portal and a self-contained HDF5 study bundle that the Shiny app and
    the companion Python webui both consume.
